<title>NEW ZEALAND: Mogridge to retire as CIL CEO.</title>
<headline>Mogridge to retire as CIL CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corporate Investments Ltd said on Thursday that Bryan Mogridge would retire as chief executive in July.</p>
<p>The position of group Chief Executive Officer will be discontinued and Peter Hubscher, managing director of Montana Wines Ltd, has been named a director of Corporate Investments.</p>
<p>Montana represents some 80 percent of the trading assets of the group. Mogridge will pursue his own investment activities and become a non-executive director of CIL.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
